    {
      "text": "Council report (2026-03-24): 38 for-sale three-bedroom rowhouses of 1,351 to 1,727 sq ft in four three-story buildings, replacing a multi-tenant industrial building (922 San Leandro) and two single-family homes (944 and 950 San Leandro), on APNs 153-18-026 and 153-18-031. All units have two-car garages, 19 tandem. Rezoning from MM (General Industrial) to R3-1.5; General Plan from General Industrial to Medium Density Residential. Formal application deemed complete 2024-10-10.",
